  "description": "YITAMOTOR floor mats completely line the interior carpet to provide all-encompassing protection. We are confident that our products will surpass your expectations and make you a happy customer!\nFitment\n2015-2024 Ford Edge SE/SEL/ST/ST-Line/Sport/Titanium\nOnly fit carpet floor, not fit vehicles with vinyl flooring.\nFor your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR floor mats use digital technology to fit 2015-2024 Ford Edge SE/SEL/ST/ST-Line/Sport/Titanium. Please remove old floor mats before installing new floor liners\nSturdy & Safe: These odorless Ford Edge floor mats are made from safe, high-density TPE material.The product contains no latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVCs, and provides comfort, extreme wear-resistance, and flexibility even in harsh cold\nAll-Season Protection: Enjoy full protection with our ford edge floor liners, featuring anti-slip retainer clips, a textured surface that helps keep cargo from shifting, and raised lip designed to trap liquids, debris, snow, mud, sand, and other elements\nEasy Maintenance: Cleaning your edge accessories is a breeze; simply remove, shake off, and hose down to achieve a pristine look. No need for vacuuming or harsh chemicals, ensuring a no-hassle maintenance\nWhy Choose Us: Our floor mats are engineered with advanced technology for tailored protection; Choose YITAMOTOR for reliable, all-weather guard and built-to-last durability",
